COMPONENT ProtectedBackupCodec

EXPORT_BACKUP(schedules, accounts, budgets)
    validate export limits
    payload = serialize application data
    return PRIVATE_SECURITY_IMPLEMENTATION.protect_backup(payload)

IMPORT_BACKUP(protected_backup)
    payload = PRIVATE_SECURITY_IMPLEMENTATION.recover_backup(protected_backup)
    validate payload format and limits
    return deserialize application data

NOTE
    The backup protection format and implementation are intentionally omitted.
